### ScreenFlow manual requests. In Visual Studio, click "Send request" above each one.
### Run the API first: dotnet run --project src/ScreenFlow.Api  (http://localhost:5129)
### Copy ids from responses into the variables below as you go.

@base = http://localhost:5129
@clientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@searchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Packages
GET {{base}}/api/v1/packages

### Create a client
POST {{base}}/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Desert Freight Lines", "industry": "Transportation" }

### Place an order (send twice: the second returns 200 with the same order)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
  "packageCode": "DOT_DRIVER",
  "clientReference": "REQ-10442",
  "candidate": {
    "firstName": "Dana", "lastName": "Reyes", "email": "dana@example.com",
    "ssn": "900-12-3456", "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-02", "state": "AZ", "county": "Maricopa"
  }
}

### Get the order
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}

### List a client's orders (newest first, keyset paging)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?clientId={{clientId}}&limit=2

### Start a search
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/searches/{{searchId}}/start

### Complete a search
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/searches/{{searchId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "Consider" }

### Review (only from ReadyForReview)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "Clear", "reviewer": "j.walker" }

### Cancel
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Audit trail
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/audit
